        <h2 id='v3-basics'>What ‘V3 games’ usually means online</h2>
        <p>When people search “V3 games” they are usually looking for a bundle of short, timer-based games—most commonly color prediction, number prediction, parity, and small lottery-style rounds. The label “V3” is often used as a category name rather than a single universal brand. That’s why you may see multiple sites that look similar but are not the same domain.</p>
