        <h2 id='rounds'>How color prediction rounds work (in plain language)</h2>
        <p>A typical V3 color prediction game shows a countdown timer. Before the timer ends, you choose a color or number and confirm your entry. At zero, the platform announces a result and updates the history list. Some platforms show charts or streaks, but those visuals do not guarantee the next outcome.</p>
        <p>The best skill here is not prediction—it’s clarity. Understand the round duration, the payout table, and the rules that affect your wallet. If rules are unclear, it’s safer to stop and research rather than guessing.</p>
