        <p>Many V3 platforms advertise bonus codes, daily rewards, and first deposit bonuses. The key question is: what conditions apply? Some bonuses are added to a bonus wallet and require turnover before withdrawal. Others reduce fees or give coupons. If you don’t understand a bonus condition, skip it and play only with your own budget.</p>
        <p>For a deeper dive, you can open our First Deposit Bonus guide. It explains common terms like rollover, lock period, minimum withdrawal, and why some bonuses feel “stuck” until conditions are met.</p>
