<details><summary>How should I use Login and Sign Up links safely?</summary><div class='muted' style='margin-top:8px'>Use only official links, check HTTPS, and avoid sharing OTPs or passwords with anyone. If a site asks for sensitive details outside the normal login flow, treat it as suspicious. For extra safety, avoid logging in on shared devices and enable any security settings the platform offers.</div></details>
